{
  "server": "en",
  "storyId": "main_1_level_main_01-03_beg",
  "groupId": "main_1",
  "stageId": "main_01-03",
  "title": "Running Wild",
  "storyCode": "1-3",
  "avgTag": "Before Operation",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/en/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_01-03_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "c2f56d1d0e6eb47d6171645b3b8998e132cd2415a8574519fb8a689c6b13a1ae",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第八关（前）\nTime - Unknown \\ Weather - Unknown \\ Visibility - Poor\nChernobog - Operation Squad E0's Location\nDr. {@nickname} Rescue Operation, Phase 3"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dobermann",
      "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
      "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
      "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "We have less than an hour left. We can't afford to make a detour..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dobermann",
      "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
      "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
      "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "The more time we waste, the more like we are to get caught in the Catastrophe."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dobermann",
      "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
      "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
      "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "We must directly cut across this area."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dobermann",
      "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
      "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
      "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "However, we won't be able to conceal our movements anymore given the size of our forces."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dobermann",
      "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
      "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
      "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "The possibility of getting ambushed when we're navigating through narrow streets is very high..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Nearl",
      "speakerToken": "char_148_nearl_1",
      "operatorId": "char_148_nearl",
      "portraitKey": "char_148_nearl",
      "text": "What's the plan?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dobermann",
      "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
      "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
      "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "We don't have many options..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dobermann",
      "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
      "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
      "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "Dr. {@nickname}, what's your assessment?"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "All we have to do is destroy them in a head-on attack!",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "Dobermann",
              "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
              "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
              "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
              "text": "Reunion's forces are no match for us individually."
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "Dobermann",
              "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
              "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
              "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
              "text": "But most of the time, they try to overwhelm us with sheer numbers."
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "Nearl",
              "speakerToken": "char_148_nearl_1",
              "operatorId": "char_148_nearl",
              "portraitKey": "char_148_nearl",
              "text": "If we can utilize our speed to constantly press forward while avoiding large-scale fights..."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "...They can't stop us, probably...",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "Dobermann",
              "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
              "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
              "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
              "text": "They don't seem to have built any fortifications."
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "Nearl",
              "speakerToken": "char_148_nearl_1",
              "operatorId": "char_148_nearl",
              "portraitKey": "char_148_nearl",
              "text": "If we're able to charge through their blockade..."
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "Dobermann",
              "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
              "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
              "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
              "text": "Even though it looks like they have a numbers advantage, their loose formation won't be able to stop our advance."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "It takes time for the enemy to regroup.",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "Dobermann",
              "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
              "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
              "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
              "text": "From what I've observed through our past battles, Reunion's communication methods are absolutely primitive."
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "Nearl",
              "speakerToken": "char_148_nearl_1",
              "operatorId": "char_148_nearl",
              "portraitKey": "char_148_nearl",
              "text": "If we do this quickly, by the time they're able to regroup and mount an effort to stop us..."
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "Dobermann",
              "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
              "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
              "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
              "text": "We'll already be long gone by the time they get into formation."
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "Nearl",
              "speakerToken": "char_148_nearl_1",
              "operatorId": "char_148_nearl",
              "portraitKey": "char_148_nearl",
              "text": "Sounds good."
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "Nearl",
              "speakerToken": "char_148_nearl_1",
              "operatorId": "char_148_nearl",
              "portraitKey": "char_148_nearl",
              "text": "We'll storm them, disrupt their formation, destroy their firebase, and then fall back quickly."
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "Nearl",
              "speakerToken": "char_148_nearl_1",
              "operatorId": "char_148_nearl",
              "portraitKey": "char_148_nearl",
              "text": "Dobermann, are you testing me, or..."
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "Dobermann",
              "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
              "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
              "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
              "text": "It's far easier to deal with threats we can see than to be stuck between a rock and a hard place."
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "Dobermann",
              "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
              "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
              "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
              "text": "I take it that these are Dr. {@nickname}'s orders, Amiya?"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "Amiya",
              "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#1",
              "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
              "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
              "text": "The situation is clear. I trust Doctor's decisions..."
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "Dobermann",
              "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
              "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
              "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
              "text": "...Trust isn't built so easily from just a single battle."
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "Dobermann",
              "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
              "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
              "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
              "text": "I do think highly of Dr. {@nickname}, Amiya..."
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "Dobermann",
              "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
              "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
              "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
              "text": "But don't let your guard down. Of course, there is nothing wrong with learning from the Doctor's wisdom, but remember, you can't fully rely on anyone else in this world."
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "Amiya",
              "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
              "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
              "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
              "text": "...I know."
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "Dobermann",
              "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
              "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
              "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
              "text": "Don't get me wrong, Doctor, I'm not trying to make things difficult for you."
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "Dobermann",
              "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
              "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
              "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
              "text": "But I hope you understand... Amiya still needs to learn and grow."
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "Dobermann",
              "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
              "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
              "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
              "text": "If you were in my position, you also wouldn't allow her to rely on someone else."
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "Dobermann",
              "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
              "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
              "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
              "text": "However, know that I've already acknowledged your abilities as a commander."
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": []
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "Thank you...",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Dobermann",
          "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
          "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
          "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
          "text": "Also, there's no reason to be so formal. We're comrades-in-arms now."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Dobermann",
          "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
          "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
          "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
          "text": "At least on the battlefield, I've already entrusted my life to you."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Dobermann",
          "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
          "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
          "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
          "text": "Enough with the chit-chatting though, let's hurry it up."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Nearl",
          "speakerToken": "char_148_nearl_1#1",
          "operatorId": "char_148_nearl",
          "portraitKey": "char_148_nearl",
          "text": "That's right."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Nearl",
          "speakerToken": "char_148_nearl_1#1",
          "operatorId": "char_148_nearl",
          "portraitKey": "char_148_nearl",
          "text": "There's an old saying in Kazimierz: 'Death catches up to you when you stop to take a break.'"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
